      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey. i've been seeing this specific \"low-fi aesthetic\" trend all over my feeds lately. like, everyone is suddenly using the same grainy filter and these specific slowed-down lofi beats. it feels... weirdly synchronized. i feel like it's hitting my demographic way harder than others. can you look into the subtext of this? like, is there any psychological reason why a trend would be engineered to target specific personality types or groups for compliance testing?",
